===Walkthrough===

After completing the Shackle of Rock Quest, Master Niska says he has heard of [troubles with an outlander].

You say, 'what troubles with an outlander'.

: [[Master Niska]] says 'It seems Klok Ephmir has encountered an outlander who was hunting the food we lizards enjoy. The Legion will not act without proof of this outlanders existence. We were asked by the Baron to find this proof. We shall do this. You shall provide me with the outlanders head and the shackles of Rock and Stone!!"

Klok ephmir can be found on the island of merchants.

You say, 'Hail [[Klok Ephmir]]'.

: [[Klok Ephmir]] stares at you with a wicked smirk. So you share the Brood's love of Frogloks. Alive, they provide much trouble. Dead, they provide much delight. I have found many uses for the Frogloks. From fine meat to fine mats. Ask if you do not see something. 

You say, 'what outlander'. 

: Klok Ephmir turns pale at the mention of the Outlander. The Outlander!! That is what the lizards in the Tink N' Babble have dubbed him!! He is tall and strong. Get close enough and he will kill you on sight!! I think he could even defeat the likes of Bruiser Noz!! I spotted him near the edge of the swamps. He was headed toward the fields of Firiona.

[[Kwinn the Outlander]] Spawns in [[Firiona Vie]]. He is a rare spawn and is usually killed by Frogloks soon after he spawns.

Kill him and he drops [[An Outlander's Head]]. Return his head and shackles of rock and stone to Master Niska to receive the {{:Shackle of Copper}}.

:Master Niska says 'This is not all. Bring me the item this caste seeks and the shackles of stone and rock.'
:Master Niska says 'This is not all. Bring me the item this caste seeks and the shackles of stone and rock.'
:Master Niska says 'Very good!! Here is your shackle of copper. The emperor shall be pleased that I, Mistress Niska, have slain the outlander. Do you have some time? I need someone to be my [personal courier]? Will you?'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with SwiftTails got better.
* Your faction standing with LegionofCabilis got better.
</div>

{{exp}}

You receive 15 gold pieces.

You receive the {{:Shackle of Copper}}.

